<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1361992" n="1"/>
  <opener><lb/>Praestantissimo Doctissimoque Viro
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao Bernoullio</rs>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-11887733X" type="person">Joannes Polenus</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></opener>
  <p><lb/>Quod promisi clarissimo Viro maximeque honorando
      <lb/>Patruo tuo <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Ioanni</rs>, certe anni diligentia et fide
      <lb/>curabo, ut obsequium meum erga vos <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117589144">Patrueli</rs>
      <lb/>tuo maxime probem. Porro vel eidem plurimum
      <lb/>deberi plane sentio: licet enim exiguo tempore
      <lb/>cum eo fuerim commoratus, novi tamen optimos
      <lb/>animi eiusdem dotes novi meliarum Disciplinarum
      <lb/>eximiam peritiam, quae cum per se illustria
      <lb/>sint, ea profecto aetate mirari satis nemo
      <lb/>potest. Vidi equidem id nobis evenisse, quod
      <lb/>longe rarissimum est, ut ex eadem familia
      <lb/>plures sint illustres <add>V</add>iri, qui de Scienti<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>s
      <lb/>mereri optime valeant. Ceterum velim pro
      <lb/>certo habeas, nihil quicquam mihi iucundius
      <lb/>esse futurum, quam si tibi pro vot<add>i</add>s mea
      <lb/>officia praestare queam. <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelottus</rs> noster
      <lb/>esse potest optimae voluntatis meae
      <lb/>praeclarus testis.</p><closer><salute>Vale, ac ut facis,
<pb facs="1361994" n="2"/>
      <lb/>me ama, et in tuis numerare perge.</salute>
      <lb/><dateline><rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavio</rs><choice><orig>.</orig><reg>,</reg></choice> <date when="1716-04-22">X<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice> <abbr>Kal.</abbr> Majas<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice> MDCCXVI.</date></dateline></closer>
</div>
</body>
</text></TEI>